sCost/WhatDreamsCost-ComfyUI)"],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":194,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[5817.945225776545,-696.8978177504553],"size":[210,88],"flags":{"collapsed":false},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"提示词","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["**提示词**\n- [LTX2.3提示词网站](https://ltx.io/blog/ltx-2-3-prompt-guide)"],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":192,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[5876.551450362851,-570.6748361141842],"size":[238.50365472592193,349.0009836627196],"flags":{"collapsed":false},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"模型区别","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["\n## 模型选择\n```\n量化级别\t文件大小\t画质保留\nQ2_K\t7.94GB\t明显下降(噪点/糊)\nQ3_K_S\t9.74GB\t中等\nQ3_K_M\t10.63GB\t中等偏好\nQ4_0\t12.72GB\t一般(不如Q3_K_M)\nQ4_1\t13.76GB\t略好于Q4_0\nQ4_K_S\t12.96GB\t轻微损失\nQ4_K_M\t14.19GB\t几乎无损\nQ5_0\t15.29GB\t略好于Q4_1\nQ5_1\t16.33GB\t略好于Q5_0\nQ5_K_S\t15.04GB\t极小损失\nQ5_K_M\t15.93GB\t接近无损\nQ6_K\t17.77GB\t近乎无损\nQ8_0\t22.76GB\t与FP16几乎无法区分\nBF16/F16\t42.04GB\t零损失\nUD-Q2_K\t10.90GB\t比Q2_K好,接近Q3_K_M\nUD-Q3_K_M\t13.41GB\t接近Q4_K_S\nUD-Q4_K_M\t16.39GB\t接近Q5_K_M\nUD-Q5_K_M\t18.21GB\t优于Q5_K_M\n\n```"],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":30,"type":"RandomNoise","pos":[8770,-610],"size":[210,90],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"噪波随机种","name":"noise_seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"noise_seed"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"噪波生成","localized_name":"噪波","name":"NOISE","type":"NOISE","links":[33,60]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.19.3","Node name for S&R":"RandomNoise","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[0,"fixed"],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":188,"type":"easy cleanGpuUsed","pos":[9777.485919223132,-451.46057931360457],"size":[140,26],"flags":{},"order":30,